Cell["\<\
We want to study what happens to this capacitor over the course of 1 second \
by dividing up time into little chunks that are 0.1 second long. Here\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s the code that does it. To understand the code, I am \
leaving two rows of the table blank for you to do.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978768919926632*^9, 3.978769149469356*^9}, {
